ngmemeval\",\"LongMemEval found round-level decomposition stronger than sessions overall.\",\"round is the best granularity for storing and utilizing the interactive history\",\"section 5, lines 26-35\",\"memory granularity\"],\n[\"longmemeval\",\"LongMemEval found fact key expansion improved retrieval and QA.\",\"4% higher recall@k and 5% higher accuracy\",\"section 5, lines 31-35\",\"multi-key indexing\"],\n[\"longmemeval\",\"LongMemEval found time-aware expansion materially helped temporal retrieval.\",\"improves recall by an average of 11.4% ... and 6.7%\",\"section 5.4, line 229\",\"temporal retrieval\"],\n[\"longmemeval\",\"LongMemEval found retrieval success alone does not guarantee answer correctness.\",\"Even with perfect memory recall, accurately reading the retrieved items is still non-trivial.\",\"section 5.5, lines 38-39\",\"reader stage\"],\n[\"multe5\",\"Multilingual E5 was contrastively trained on large multilingual paired data.\",\"contrastive pre-training on 1 billion multilingual text pairs\",\"abstract\",\"multilingual embeddings\"],\n[\"bgem3\",\"BGE-M3 supports multilingual dense, sparse, and multivector retrieval.\",\"support more than 100 working languages\",\"abstract\",\"multilingual retrieval\"],\n[\"reranker\",\"Cross-encoder reranking materially improved a passage benchmark.\",\"outperforming the previous state of the art by 27% relative in MRR@10\",\"abstract\",\"cross-encoder reranking\"],\n[\"queryrewrite\",\"Query rewriting addresses mismatch between user utterance and retrieval need.\",\"there is inevitably a gap between the input text and the needed knowledge\",\"abstract\",\"query rewriting\"],\n[\"contextual\",\"Anthropic reports contextualized chunks reduced retrieval failure in its own tests.\",\"reduced the top-20-chunk retrieval failure rate by 35%\",\"Performance improvements\",\"contextual retrieval vendor study\"],\n[\"contextual\",\"Anthropic reports its best contextual plus reranked setup reduced failure further.\",\"red